"""Built-in catalog of model providers and a curated Ollama model library.

Every endpoint below was checked to exist (an unauthenticated request returns 401/403 or a
model list). Cloud providers need your API key, which ATLAS stores in the macOS Keychain.
Nearly all cloud providers speak the OpenAI chat-completions protocol, so they share the
`openai_compat` adapter; Anthropic has a native adapter.
"""
